# Current Processing Components

| Component                        | Responsibility          |
| -------------------------------- | ----------------------- |
| CreateDocumentVersionUseCase     | Upload workflow         |
| LocalFileStorageService          | Store original file     |
| DefaultDocumentProcessingService | Pipeline orchestration  |
| PdfBoxTextExtractor              | Text extraction         |
| CharacterChunkingService         | Chunk generation        |
| DefaultEmbeddingService          | Embedding orchestration |
| OllamaEmbeddingGenerator         | Generate vectors        |
| EmbeddingRepository              | Persist vectors         |

